        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Diffutils package contains programs that show the differences between files or directories."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "segmented_list",
          "titles": [
            "Approximate build time",
            "Required disk space"
          ],
          "values": [
            "0.1 SBU",
            "35 MB"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "role": "package"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Installation of Diffutils",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Prepare Diffutils for compilation:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bootstrap_command",
          "index": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "definition_list",
          "title": "The meaning of the configure options:",
          "entries": [
            {
              "term": [
                {
                  "type": "code",
                  "text": "gl_cv_func_strcasecmp_works=yes"
                }
              ],
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This option specify the result of a check for the"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "text": "strcasecmp"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "function. The check requires running a compiled C program, and this is impossible during cross-compilation because in general a cross-compiled program cannot run on the host distro. Normally for such a check the"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "text": "configure"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "script would use a fall-back value for cross-compilation, but the fall-back value for this check is absent and the"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "text": "configure"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "script would have no value to use and error out. Upstream have already fixed the issue, but to apply the fix we'd need to run"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "text": "autoconf"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "that the host distro may lack. So we just specify the check result ("
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "text": "yes"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "as we know the"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "text": "strcasecmp"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "function in Glibc-2.44 works fine) instead, then"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "text": "configure"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "will just use the specified value and skip the check."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Compile the package:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bootstrap_command",
          "index": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Install the package:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bootstrap_command",
          "index": 2
        }
